# Playwright (M1.7). `e2e/.auth` holds **live session cookies** for the
# synthetic accounts — short-lived and against a local stack, but a session
# token is a credential and credentials are never committed (docs/SECURITY.md
# §9, mandatory rule 3). The rest is per-run output: traces, screenshots and
# the HTML report.
frontend/e2e/.auth/
frontend/e2e/.artifacts/
playwright-report/
test-results/

